{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12173","headline":"长安客舍赠李行父明府 · 钱起","name":"长安客舍赠李行父明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"藏器待时少，知人自古难。\n遂令丹穴凤，晚食金琅玕。\n谁谓兵戈际，鸣琴方一弹。\n理烦善用简，济猛能兼宽。\n夙夜念黎庶，寝兴非宴安。\n洪波未静壑，何树不惊鸾。\n凫舄傍京辇，甿心悬灌坛。\n高槐暗苦雨，长剑生秋寒。\n旅食还爲客，饥年亦尽欢。\n亲劳携斗水，往往救泥蟠。\n但恐酬明义，蹉跎芳岁阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}